#: src/driverpage.cpp:312
msgid "Already Installed"
msgstr "Déjà installé"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:313
msgid ""
"The driver package \"%1\" is already installed.\n"
"No further action is required."
msgstr ""
"Le paquet de pilotes « %1 » est déjà installé.\n"
"Aucune autre action n'est nécessaire."

#: src/driverpage.cpp:322
msgid "Different Driver Installed"
msgstr "Autre pilote installé"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:323
msgid ""
"The package \"%1\" is currently installed.\n"
"Installing \"%2\" will replace it.\n"
"\n"
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Le paquet « %1 » est actuellement installé.\n"
"L'installation de « %2 » le remplacera.\n"
"\n"
"Continuer ?"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:337 src/driverpage.cpp:509
msgid "Secure Boot Detected"
msgstr "Secure Boot détecté"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:338
msgid ""
"Secure Boot is enabled. The NVIDIA kernel module must be signed.\n"
"Configure a Machine Owner Key (MOK) now?"
msgstr ""
"Secure Boot est activé. Le module noyau NVIDIA doit être signé.\n"
"Configurer maintenant une Machine Owner Key (MOK) ?"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:360
msgid "NVIDIA Driver Installation Log"
msgstr "Journal d'installation du pilote NVIDIA"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:368
msgid "Installation Failed"
msgstr "Échec de l'installation"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:369
msgid ""
"The installation did not complete. Please check the log:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"L'installation ne s'est pas terminée. Veuillez consulter le journal :\n"
"%1"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:378
msgid ""
"The NVIDIA driver was installed successfully. Open System Monitor and wait "
"for the cc1 processes and the subsequent dnf5 process to finish, then reboot "
"to start using it.\n"
"\n"
"Log saved to: %1"
msgstr ""
"Le pilote NVIDIA a été installé avec succès. Ouvrez le moniteur système et "
"attendez la fin des processus cc1 puis du processus dnf5, puis redémarrez "
"pour l'utiliser.\n"
"\n"
"Journal enregistré dans : %1"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:386
msgid ""
"nvidia-smi is not installed. The CUDA package for this driver branch is not "
"available, so the nvidia-smi monitoring tool is missing."
msgstr ""
"nvidia-smi n'est pas installé. Le paquet CUDA pour cette branche de pilote "
"n'est pas disponible, l'outil de surveillance nvidia-smi est donc absent."

#: src/driverpage.cpp:390 src/driverpage.cpp:556
msgid "Installation Complete"
msgstr "Installation terminée"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:399
msgid ""
"This will remove the NVIDIA driver packages and switch back to the Nouveau "
"driver.\n"
"\n"
"Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Cela supprimera les paquets de pilotes NVIDIA et reviendra au pilote "
"Nouveau.\n"
"\n"
"Continuer ?"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:407
msgid "Nouveau Restore Log"
msgstr "Journal de restauration de Nouveau"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:414 src/driverpage.cpp:563
msgid "Uninstall Complete"
msgstr "Désinstallation terminée"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:415
msgid ""
"The NVIDIA driver packages were removed. Reboot to use the Nouveau driver."
msgstr ""
"Les paquets de pilotes NVIDIA ont été supprimés. Redémarrez pour utiliser le "
"pilote Nouveau."

#: src/driverpage.cpp:418 src/driverpage.cpp:467 src/driverpage.cpp:494
#: src/driverpage.cpp:545
